<title>PORTUGAL: FORECAST - Results for top Portuguese blue-chips.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Results for top Portuguese blue-chips.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a table of analysts' results forecasts for a number of leading Portuguese companies following updates by Fincor and ESR. Figures are in billions of escudos, with brackets indicating a loss.</p>
<p>		  BCP   BTA  CIMPOR   PORTUCEL  TELECOM  SONAE INV</p>
<p>FINCOR 1996</p>
<p>Net profit    n.a   n.a    24.0	(0.5)    50.4     14.2</p>
<p>Cashflow	n.a   n.a    41.5	 6.5    176.3     33.2</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p>Net profit    n.a   n.a    24.9	 1.3     61.7     15.8</p>
<p>Cash-flow     n.a   n.a    39.7	 8.9    195.7     37.9</p>
<p>M.VALORES 1996</p>
<p>Net profit    22.1  16.5   18.2	(0.4)    47.3     12.2</p>
<p>Cashflow	73.9  43.4   37.6	 6.9    161.6     28.1</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p>Net profit    24.3  16.9   21.7	 7.3     60.6     14.8</p>
<p>Cashflow	74.3  43.1   40.7	14.2    181.5     40.6</p>
<p>TOTTADEALER 1996</p>
<p>Net profit    20.4  n.a    24.6	 0.6     46.1     10.9</p>
<p>Cashflow	n.a   n.a    42.4	 8.0    162.1     28.1</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p>Net profit    25.5  n.a    20.1	 5.6     55.2     13.5</p>
<p>Cashflow	n.a   n.a    39.1	13.5    179.5     35.0</p>
<p>ESR-Espirito Santo Research 1996</p>
<p>Net profit    22.2  19.8   20.2	(1.4)    50.0	8.0</p>
<p>Cashflow     156.2  42.8   44.6	 5.3    170.0     34.3</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p>Net profit    23.0  17.7   22.5	 2.6     60.2     11.0</p>
<p>Cashflow     159.0  35.6   41.4	 9.5    184.0     26.2</p>
<p>The full company names are Banco Totta &amp; Acores, Banco Comercial Portugues, Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal, Portucel Industrial, Portugal Telecom, Sonae Investimentos.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
